  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Facilitating adoption of sustainable public transport services for low-carbon city development</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project aims to improve public mobility in Sri Lanka though facilitating the adoption of sustainable public transport services by introducing electric buses and intelligent transport system (Bus Information and Management System (BIMS) and Public Bicycle Support System (PBSS). The project has 3 components: (1) Technical preparation for sustainable public transport services; (2) Development of enabling environment; and (3) Preparation of investment proposals.</narrative>
  </description>
